OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy across much of Scotland
OL,6,Fand Northern Ireland with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain, turning heavy and persistent
OL,8,Facross western Scotland. Dry elsewhere
OL,9,Fwith plenty of sunshine in the south
OL,10,Fonce early fog clears mid to late
OL,11,Fmorning. Feeling warm in sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud, outbreaks of rain and
OL,14,Fbrisk winds across Scotland and
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland will sink southwards
OL,16,Finto northern England and Wales. Clear
OL,17,Fspells elsewhere leading to some fog
OL,18,Fforming by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
