OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry with sunny spells in the
OL,6,Fsouth and east, once any fog clears.
OL,7,FCloudier elsewhere with some patchy
OL,8,Frain, heaviest and most persistent on
OL,9,Fnorthwestern upslopes.
